'''High Class Archfiend Dice''' is a {{Legendary}} item.

== Obtaining ==
'''High Class Archfiend Dice''' is a {{o|rng|no=y}} ({{Green|0.25%}}) drop obtained from the [[Inferno Demonlord]] {{SlayerTier|IV}}+ with {{Coll|Blaze Slayer 7}}.

== Usage ==
{{ItemInfo
|rarity = legendary
|item_ability_name = Try Your Luck
|item_ability_activation = Right Click
|item_ability_description = Costs {{Gold|6.7M}} coins to roll between 1-6. <br> Gain between {{Red|-300❤}} and {{Red|+300❤}} for {{Green|24h}}. <br> {{Dark Gray|Overwritten by new rolls!}} <br> <br> If you roll a {{Red|6}}, earn {{Gold|100M}} coins but lose this dice. <br> {{DarkGray|Heavy in the hand. Could someone have tampered with it?}}
}}
To use a '''High Class Archfiend Dice''', it costs {{c|6,666,666}}. It will roll, and land on a number between 1 and 7. The player can gain between {{stat|hp|+300}} and {{stat|hp|-300}}. This effect lasts for {{Green|24 hours}}.

The dice first attempts to roll for a 7 ({{Chance|0.15%|1|666|rolls}}, can be buffed {{Green|2x}}–{{Green|3x}} by {{NPCSprite|Vincent}}). If this fails, it attempts to roll for a 6 ({{Chance|6.25%|1|16|rolls}}). If this fails too, it rolls for a number between 1 and 5 with equal chances.

If the dice lands on a {{Red|6}}, the player gains {{C|100M}}, but loses the dice. If the dice lands on a {{Red|7}}, the player gains an {{Item|Archfiend Dye}}, but loses the dice.

